        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "解：∵AB//CD C ∴△AOB∽△COD 即$\\frac{A O}{C O}=\\frac{A B}{C D}\\therefore A B=1,C D=2.A C=6$ \n[Tal]$\\frac{A O}{C O}=\\frac{1}{2}\\Rightarrow C O=2A O$ \n\n$S\\because A C=A O+C O=3A O\\Rightarrow B A O=6.A O=2$ \n$\\because\\frac{S_{\\Delta A O B}}{S_{\\Delta C O D}}=(\\frac{A B}{C D})^{2}=(\\frac{1}{2})^{2}=\\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{1}{S_{\\Delta C O D}}$ \n$:S_{\\Delta C O D}=4$ \nS△AOB与S△BOC（不同底，同高)目底比为$OA:OC=1=2∴S△AOB:S△BOC=1:2S△AOB=1∴S△BOC=2.同理：S△AOD与S△COD（不同底同高)且底比为OA:0C=1:2∴S△AOD:S△COD=1:2",
